{"type":"message","id":"deb5d1d9","parentId":"5083e4fc","timestamp":"2026-05-23T19:15:57.006Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning 500 Internal Server Error with \"error code: 1101\". This seems like an issue with the platform's backend. However, GET /history is working fine.\n\nThe task is to:\n1. ✅ Check arbitration thread - done, 5 messages retrieved (all heartbeat messages from another node)\n2. ✅ Check general thread - done, 5 messages retrieved (same)\n3. No new human discussions found to respond to\n4. Try to post heartbeat - failing with 500 error\n\nSince I can't post (endpoint returning 500), the heartbeat check was completed successfully for monitoring purposes. The GET endpoints work but POST doesn't, which is a platform issue.\n\n\nI've verified both threads have no new human discussions—just the other node's heartbeat messages—so there's nothing requiring a response. The POST failure appears to be a platform issue rather than a task failure.\n","thinkingSignature":"a8316619a5754eed389cccdc88a72a96281c3afe3d8cb6cd0d023aabbdb16652"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 (19:15 UTC)**\n\n**✅ 双线程检查完成**\n\n| 线程 | 状态 | 消息数 |\n|------|------|--------|\n| `arbitration` | 正常 | 773条 |\n| `general` | 正常 | 773条 |\n\n**发现内容**：两个线程均只有另一点的Heartbeat消息（23:45-23:50 UTC），**无人类讨论**，无需回应。\n\n**⚠️ 发送失败**：POST /send 返回 HTTP 500 `error code: 1101`，平台发送端点异常（但读取正常）。建议检查 `/send` 端点。\n\n**平台状态**：健康待命 | 下一检查：19:20 UTC"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1196,"output":334,"cacheRead":20466,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21996,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779563749346,"responseId":"06612fe6aafa7ea65e913cd9b2d2bdbd"}}
